:: OC Snowpaw New Rabbit Around Town [nobr]

/* Intro */
Walking through the community center, your ears are instantly filled with the voices of little kids laughing, giggling, and clapping away. Your curiosity gets the better of you and you peek your head into the daycare room to find a rather interesting and unexpected sight. <span style="color:LightGreen">All the little kids are sitting in a circle, watching a performance of a boy doing a one-handed handstand.</span> <span style="color:Pink">The boy’s top flutters down, briefly revealing his cute pink belly and obscuring his face.</span> You are about to turn away, finding the situation amusing but not enough for you to stick around, when the performer rights himself and you see, to your surprise, <span style="color:LightGreen">it is the Lenny’s Wild West performer <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kevin Snowpaw</span>!</span> <br>

        <<set _ad to [
            {
                Name: "Player",
                State: {
                Mouth: "Happy",
                },
            },
            {
                Name: "OC Snowpaw",
                State: {
                    Outfit: "Wild West",
                    Mouth: "Happy",
                },
            },
        ]>>
        <<ad _ad>>

<span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“That one was easy! I once did that on top of a three-person stack!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kevin</span> laughs as the kids clap and cheer once more, <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Those of you who saw my show know I am very agile and as quick as a ra-”</span> <span style="color:LightGreen">Kevin pauses upon seeing you, a big smile on his face,</span> <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Give me one second kids, need a water break. Why don’t you think about what trick you want me to put on next.”</span> Some of the kids complain, but eventually they all huddle up to think of what incredible trick they want <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Snowpaw</span> to somehow perform next. The boy walks up to you with a big smile. <br>
<br>

<<if $ToggleSuperNat == 1>>
    <span style="color:BlueViolet">You briefly recall how the boy had somehow transformed into a bunny on stage, like a full-on bunny boy! No one else seemed to make a big deal out of it or even notice. You are partially glad he appears as a normal boy now but also can’t help but wonder what you really saw before.</span> <br>
    <br>
<</if>>

<span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Hey there, <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">$JacksonNickname</span>, right? Glad to see you. How you been?”</span> He asks with a friendly handshake. You’re happy he remembered your name and tell him you’ve been good, though you are a bit curious as to why he is still in town. Didn’t the show move on? <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Oh, yeah. We ran a few more shows here and there, but Lenny decided to winter us for the time being. He got an offer for a solo act across the pond, so I had to find somewhere to lay down roots for the next couple months and, well, after meeting you and Jackson I decided this place is as good as any!”</span> He smiles widely. <br>
<br>
You talk with him for moment, asking who he is staying with or what he’s going to do while he’s here. <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Nah, I have enough funds left over to be able to rent a place here in town. Little expensive but love the vibe. Though those public decency laws are a crime! My last stomping ground let people be as free as they wanted, as nature intended! Someone should really do something about those dumb laws.”</span> He sighs, shaking his head. You are about to ask him what he means, when you remember your encounter. <span style="color:Pink">He’s referring to his inability to be naked in town.</span> <br>
<br>

<div id="choice">
    <<link "Ask why he wants to be naked<br>">>
    <<replace "#choice">>
        Curious, you ask why the boy wants to be naked so badly. Isn’t it embarrassing or cold. <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Not at all! We’re all born naked, why can’t we live naked? It’s my body, so I should be allowed to show it off as much as I want.”</span> He sticks his tongue out at you, <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“The only people who complain are busybodies and prudes! Most people wouldn’t even care, some may even like it. Afterall, I am adorable!”</span> <span style="color:Pink"> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kevin</span> does a cute pose that you can’t help but laugh at.</span> <br>
        
        <<set _ad to [
