            },
        ]>>
        <<ad _ad>>

        <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“But it’s just natural, you know? That feeling you get when you’re naked, that’s how I feel with clothes.”</span> You nod along as he explains, you’ve never considered that before. <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“But, hey, at least I can check the mail or go for a jog without needing pants on. Sucks I have to whip them out to come here though. Offered to help entertain some of the kids, it’s a pretty nice gig.”</span> <br>
        <br>
        <<include"OC Snowpaw New Rabbit Around Town 2">>
    <</replace>>
    <</link>>
    <<link "Comment on his similarity to Jackson<br>">>
    <<replace "#choice">>
        You laugh, saying he is so much like Jackson. <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“I take that as a compliment.”</span> He says with a big smile, <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“I ran into him after I put down my seasonal roots. He was a little star struck, but he also gave me the rundown of this place. He’s a pretty cool dude and gets me. Why should we have to wear pants if we don’t want to? It’s government overreach, if you ask me.”</span> You laugh, though <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kevin</span> seems pretty serious. <br>
        
