        <<ad _ad>>

        <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“But hey, at least I met a like-minded lad here; hopefully two.”</span> He gives you a smirk, <span style="color:Pink">probably hoping you’ll join him and Jackson on some naked fun.</span> You don’t give an answer either way. <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“But it isn’t all bad. I got this nice gig helping out here. Love entertaining kids, even if I can’t use most of my gear. But I love seeing them smile.”</span> <br>
        <br>
