            Unable to get the image out of your head, you ask him about the bunny trick. <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Bunny trick? My show may have been magical, but I didn’t pull anything out of a hat or anything like that.”</span> He laughs, <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Don’t think we have a magician in the show, but that would be a good addition. I should text Lenny…”</span> You interrupt him, saying that you are talking about how he suddenly was wearing a bunny costume or something on stage! <br>
            
