:: OC Snowpaw New Rabbit Around Town 2 [nobr]

/* Intro */

As if on cue, the group of elementary and preschoolers begin to call and pull away <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kevin</span>, wanting their funny friend back to continue performing tricks for them. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Snowpaw</span> laughs as he is tugged away by the little hands and gives you a wave. <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Duty calls! I’ll see you around!”</span> <span style="color:LightGreen">You watch for a moment more as <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Snowpaw</span> begins to do an impressive, though slightly dangerous trick before walking off.</span> <br>
